=2 Walkthrough
* Head to the **Rhinostery** in {z:Windurst Waters (S)} southern map (I-8) and examine the southern door for a cutscene.
** There are two **Rhinostery doors**. The one on the right (south) starts this quest.
** **(Optional)**: Check the door a second time for a reminder of where to go.
* With a {i:Mythril Beastcoin|Mtl. Beastcoin|749} in hand, head to {z:Giddeus} and locate {n:Quu Bokye} in the lower levels.
** The {i:Mythril Beastcoin|Mtl. Beastcoin|749} can be farmed or purchased on the {z:Auction House}. ({@g:Auction House} > Others > Beast-made)
* Trade {n:Quu Bokye} the {i:Mythril Beastcoin|Mtl. Beastcoin|749} to receive {@k} {k:Leather-bound book}.
** **(Optional)**: Talk to Quu Bokye before trading for some text.
* Return to the **Rhinostery** door in {z:Windurst Waters (S)}.
** **(Optional)**: Check the door a second time for a reminder of where to go.
* Head to the **Optistery** door in {z:Windurst Waters (S)} (F-8 on the first map) for the next cutscene. They request a sheet of {i:Vellum|Vellum|2550} and a {@k} {k:Lynx pelt}.
** The {i:Vellum|Vellum|2550} can be crafted or purchased on the {z:Auction House}. ({@g:Auction House} > Materials > Leathercraft)
* Travel to {z:Castle Oztroja (S)} and find the **???** at (G-8) on the first floor. Examine it to receive the {@k} {k:Lynx pelt}.
* Return to **Optistery** in {z:Windurst Waters (S)} and trade the {i:Vellum|Vellum|2550} to the door for a cutscene.
* Wait one game day then return to the **Optistery** to receive the {s:Scroll of Retrace|Retrace (Scroll)}.

